1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,820
 I've spent hundreds of hours using every ChatGBT prompt I can.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:04,880
 Don't waste your time.

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,880
 Here are the top three prompts that have actually saved me time

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,460
 and made me more productive day-to-day.

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,260
 The first is how to use the 80-20 rule.

6
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,900
 The 80-20 rule is actually a scary rule,

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,200
 which means that 80% of outputs often come from 20% of inputs.

8
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,640
 This is what you need to type.

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,600
 I want to learn about input the topic,

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,580
 find and share the most important 20% of learnings on this topic

11
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:29,260
 that will help me understand 80% of it.

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:33,320
 And ChatGBT will then create you learnings on that topic to get you there faster.

13
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:37,280
 Number two, if you want to improve your writing, ask ChatGBT for feedback.

14
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:40,240
 So copy and paste your writing into ChatGBT and type,

15
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:44,140
 I want you to proofread my writing, fix any spelling or grammar mistakes,

16
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,620
 and make suggestions to improve the quality and clarity of my writing.

17
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,100
 And if you want to get instant summaries of documents and articles,

18
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:55,040
 just type in, I want you to summarize the text

19
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:58,240
 and give me a bullet point breakdown of the key points and facts.

20
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:02,040
 And ChatGBT will come back to you with a clearly broken down key points

21
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,200
 about whatever you've given them.

22
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,520
 And so those are my three key prompts that I'm using day to day.

